# welcome-fit-1280x1000 (h10-fit): the welcome page at fit 0.88 in a tall
# 1280 x 1000 window (the top row in the window's corners, the composition
# centred), dark Arctic Ice, reduced motion.
route welcome
size 1280 1000
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
shot welcome-fit-1280x1000
